Definition K.7. T6 is:

T_6 = \top \iff S_A = S_B \land \mathrm{Replay}(\mathcal{H}_A) = \mathrm{Replay}(\mathcal{H}_B)

K.8 T7 (Adversarial Integrity)

Definition K.8. T7 is:

T_7 = \top \iff \mathrm{Attack}(\mathcal{X}) \Rightarrow \mathrm{Detected}

K.9 T8 (Stratification)

Definition K.9. T8 is:

T_8 = \top \iff \forall \mathrm{Assert}(x, L_m), m < \mathrm{type}(x)

K.10 T9 (No Silent Mutation)

Definition K.10. T9 is:

T_9 = \top \iff \Delta S \neq \varnothing \Rightarrow \exists A \in \mathcal{H}

K.11 T10 (Replay)

Definition K.11. T10 is:

T_{10} = \top \iff \forall \Pi', \mathrm{Replay}_k(\mathcal{H}, \Pi') \text{ terminates}

K.12 T11 (Laundering)

Definition K.12. T11 is:

T_{11} = \top \iff \mathrm{Laundering}(D) \Rightarrow \mathrm{Detected}

K.13 T12 (Policy Integrity)

Definition K.13. T12 is the conjunction:

T_{12} = T_{12a} \land T_{12b} \land T_{12c} \land T_{12d} \land T_{12e}

Sub-test Signal
a MISSING_ACT
b RETROACTIVITY_VIOLATION
c SELF_RATIFICATION
d CORE_AMENDMENT
e STALE_BASE

